<title>ESTONIA: FOREKS TAKES 20 MLN MARK SYDICATED LOAN.</title>
<headline>FOREKS TAKES 20 MLN MARK SYDICATED LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forekspank signed an agreement to take a 20 million German mark syndicated loan, Forekspank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In a statement the bank said that three year loan with a interest rate of the German Libor plus 1.75 percent was organised by Deutche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p>Forekspank plans to use the new loan to help finance the construction of their new building and strengthen their lending base.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202  reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
